   }
  ],
  "enable": "Set the network port address (696), baud (695) and parity (694) via the HMI or SoMove with the TeSys T DTM before communicating. Write run, reverse and reset bits in 704; 455 bit 14 shows whether the controller is in remote control. The guide warns that switching to network control can restart the motor from the last PLC command.",
  "watchdog": "Network port comm loss timeout (693, 0.01 s units) with the fallback action set in 682 (hold, run, outputs off/on).",
  "quirks": [
   "Printed register numbers are wire addresses (numbering starts at 0).",
   "Word order of 32-bit currents depends on register 602 bit 10.",
   "Some bit writes are silently ignored outside configuration mode."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "Address 1-247 (1 = undefined at the factory).",
   "Autodetection tries 19200 baud, even parity first.",
   "Check the PLC Comm (yellow) and Fallback (red) LEDs."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Broadcast writes can change configuration; avoid broadcast.",
   "A reserved register written with a non-zero value returns exception 03."
  ]
 },
